      "value": "@{640c76efcced024514ae4d6a|full_name} I think you misunderstand me, so far there is only for groups this option not for all other instance types and currently it is not really good to manage events (we are talking about an invite only lobby)\n\nI currently have to look at each user profile individually to check whether 18+ or not, which is extremely time-consuming to simplify this, there are two possibilities: either you set 18+ for all instance types or you give the world creators the opportunity to make the status that you can already see on the website available in game!!!!",
