      "value": "@{5f293f21f7553f5a9ad29221|full_name} there is a difference if you show it in your profile, or you read the profile via script.\n\nThe first is the users choice, the second is a privacy violation.\n\nFurther up you mentioned: \"(we are talking about an invite only lobby)\".\n\nWhy is there the need then anyways? this makes totally no sense. If you invite the users, then you might already checked them beforehand?",
