      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{640c76efcced024514ae4d6a|full_name} api scapers like vrcx can also read this data and log it, or you could simply check manually every day. the privacy concern would be with displaying \"age verified\" and \"verified 18+\" separately in the first place.",
