      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Sorry, abuse potential? How? Where?\n\nIf a user publicly displays they are 18+ verified in their profile, a simple isAgeVerified bool on the VRCPlayerAPI object to be true is all anyone needs or is asking for here.\n\nIf a user is verified but under 18, on their birthday just turn their status to hidden. User has plausible deniability at that point.\n\nAside from that, its just a birthday. Verified users without the 18+ tag but still visibly verified are already advertising to the world they're a minor. Don't you think that's a slightly bigger problem than someone noticing 'hey friend, you were verified yesterday but verified 18+ today, wow it must be your birthday'..\n\nC'mon now..",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
